the January 6th committee.

00:20:06.960 --> 00:20:09.635
- I don't know that you
get to stop that anyway.

00:20:09.635 --> 00:20:11.880
- Additionally, Jones'
lawyers are in hot water.

00:20:11.880 --> 00:20:13.560
Reynal is facing potential discipline

00:20:13.560 --> 00:20:14.790
by the Connecticut Bar.

00:20:14.790 --> 00:20:17.370
On the same day that the Texas
jury handed down the verdict,

00:20:17.370 --> 00:20:19.860
a judge ordered Reynal and
Jones' lawyer, Norm Pattis,

00:20:19.860 --> 00:20:21.960
to attend a hearing about
whether they should be referred

00:20:21.960 --> 00:20:24.420
to disciplinary authorities or sanctioned

00:20:24.420 --> 00:20:25.260
by the court directly

00:20:25.260 --> 00:20:27.270
for releasing confidential medical records

00:20:27.270 --> 00:20:29.430
in violation of state and federal law,

00:20:29.430 --> 00:20:32.400
in the contra of the
court's protective order.

00:20:32.400 --> 00:20:33.810
And although Jones told the jury

00:20:33.810 --> 00:20:36.570
that any verdict over
$2 million will sink us,

00:20:36.570 --> 00:20:38.760
after the verdict, Jones'
lawyer assured reporters

00:20:38.760 --> 00:20:40.710
